{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-42956","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-49393","text":"Graphonomous MCP — Agent Skills"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42958","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49394","marks":["bold"],"text":"Purpose:"},{"id":"spn-49395","text":" Teach any LLM connected to Graphonomous how to use its MCP machines correctly, idiomatically, and in the right sequence. These reference docs mirror the skills in the "},{"id":"spn-49396","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"https://github.com/c-u-l8er/ampersand-plugins"}],"text":"ampersand-plugins"},{"id":"spn-49397","text":" Claude Code plugin. For Claude Code users, install the plugin directly: "},{"id":"spn-49398","marks":["code"],"text":"claude plugin add c-u-l8er/ampersand-plugins"}]}],"id":"blk-42957","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-42959","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49399","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-42960","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-49400","text":"Quick Orientation"}]},{"id":"blk-42961","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49401","text":"Graphonomous is a "},{"id":"spn-49402","marks":["bold"],"text":"continual learning engine"},{"id":"spn-49403","text":" exposed as 5 MCP machines. It maintains a "},{"id":"spn-49404","marks":["bold"],"text":"self-evolving knowledge graph"},{"id":"spn-49405","text":" of semantic, procedural, episodic, temporal, outcome, and goal nodes connected by typed, weighted edges. Your job as an LLM agent is to "},{"id":"spn-49406","marks":["bold"],"text":"read from and write to this graph"},{"id":"spn-49407","text":" as you work, creating a durable memory that improves over time."}]},{"id":"blk-42962","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-49408","text":"The Core Loop"}]},{"id":"blk-42963","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49409","text":"Every interaction should follow this rhythm:"}]},{"id":"blk-42964","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"retrieve → route → act → learn → consolidate\n\"What do I know?\" → \"What should I do?\" → \"Do it\" → \"Did it work?\" → \"Clean up\""},{"id":"blk-42965","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-49410","text":"Machine Architecture (v0.4)"}]},{"id":"blk-42966","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49411","text":"Graphonomous v0.4 exposes "},{"id":"spn-49412","marks":["bold"],"text":"5 loop-phase machines"},{"id":"spn-49413","text":" instead of 29 individual tools. Each machine accepts an "},{"id":"spn-49414","marks":["code"],"text":"action"},{"id":"spn-49415","text":" parameter:"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-42968","spans":[{"id":"spn-49416","text":"Machine"}]},{"id":"blk-42969","spans":[{"id":"spn-49417","text":"Phase"}]},{"id":"blk-42970","spans":[{"id":"spn-49418","text":"Actions"}]}],"id":"blk-42967","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-42971","spans":[{"id":"spn-49419","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve"}]},{"id":"blk-42972","spans":[{"id":"spn-49420","text":"\"What do I know?\""}]},{"id":"blk-42973","spans":[{"id":"spn-49421","text":"context, episodic, procedural, coverage, trace_evidence, frontier"}]}],[{"id":"blk-42974","spans":[{"id":"spn-49422","marks":["code"],"text":"route"}]},{"id":"blk-42975","spans":[{"id":"spn-49423","text":"\"What should I do?\""}]},{"id":"blk-42976","spans":[{"id":"spn-49424","text":"topology, deliberate, attention_survey, attention_cycle, review_goal"}]}],[{"id":"blk-42977","spans":[{"id":"spn-49425","marks":["code"],"text":"act"}]},{"id":"blk-42978","spans":[{"id":"spn-49426","text":"\"Do it\""}]},{"id":"blk-42979","spans":[{"id":"spn-49427","text":"store_node, store_edge, delete_node, manage_edge, manage_goal, belief_revise, forget_node, forget_policy, gdpr_erase"}]}],[{"id":"blk-42980","spans":[{"id":"spn-49428","marks":["code"],"text":"learn"}]},{"id":"blk-42981","spans":[{"id":"spn-49429","text":"\"Did it work?\""}]},{"id":"blk-42982","spans":[{"id":"spn-49430","text":"from_outcome, from_feedback, detect_novelty, from_interaction, contradictions"}]}],[{"id":"blk-42983","spans":[{"id":